inal_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5999999999999974, "y": 32.137062937062936, "width": 69.49999999999999, "height": 42.36293706293705, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5999999999999974, "y": 32.137062937062936, "width": 69.49999999999999, "height": 42.36293706293705, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["equation"]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5999999999999974, "y": 32.137062937062936, "width": 69.49999999999999, "height": 42.36293706293705, "rotation": 0, "text": ["BOUNDED-LADDER_DFA = {(B, u, v, b) | B a DFA and u \u2192_b v a ladder in L(B)}\n\nB\u00b7L = \"On input (B, u, v, b) Let m = |u| = |v|.\n1. For b = 1, accept if u, v \u2208 L(B) and differ in \u2264 1 place, else reject.\n2. For b > 1, repeat for each w \u2208 L(B) of length |u|\n3. Recursively test u \u2192_b/2 w and w \u2192_b/2 v [division rounds up]\n4. Accept both accept.\n5. Reject [if all fail].\"\n\nTest (B, u, v) \u2208 LADDER_DFA with B\u00b7L procedure on input (B, u, v, t) for t = |\u03a3|^m"]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5, "y": 75.9, "width": 46.5, "height": 17.9, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5, "y": 75.9, "width": 46.5, "height": 17.9, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5, "y": 75.9, "width": 46.5, "height": 17.9, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Space analysis:\nEach recursive level uses space O(n) (to record w).\nRecursion depth is log t = O(m) = O(n).\nTotal space used is O(n^2)."]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.54763986013988, "y": 38.18181818181819, "width": 25.374737762237704, "height": 39.97272727272724, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.54763986013988, "y": 38.18181818181819, "width": 25.374737762237704, "height": 39.97272727272724, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["image"]}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.54763986013988, "y": 38.18181818181819, "width": 25.374737762237704, "height": 39.97272727272724, "rotation": 0, "text": [""]}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 50.3, "y": 79.8, "width": 40.7, "height": 11.2, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 50.3, "y": 79.8, "width": 40.7, "height": 11.2, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["image"]}, "id": "BB_6", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 50.3, "y": 79.8, "width": 